From 1eb3e189525670e1056e89ef4bc49ab7f0d481dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:43:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kernel-views): project configured uname identity at
 launch

Encode domain-owned utsname fields in the existing identity view and expose
them through configured launch with strict tracee copyout. Keep native
syscall defaults and sysinfo behavior unchanged.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
